( -updated_linear compressibility increment, audit cluster K01.
  Two bars in series (Pro test other/interac1): bar 1 elastic E=1,
  bar 2 only group_materi_elasti_compressibility 1. The left node is
  displaced over 0.01, the right node is fixed. Analytic: both bars
  take strain -0.005 and stress -0.005.
  The volumetric increment must come from inc_epe; with new_epe-old_epe
  and no materi_strain_elasti the total strain was added every step
  (pre-fix GNU: sigxx -0.01, eptxx node 3 ~ 0).
  Pro 02-08-2026: sigxx -0.005, eptxx -0.005 at every node. )
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 1
materi_velocity
materi_strain_total
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1  0
node 2  1
node 3  2
element 1  -bar2 1 2
element 2  -bar2 2 3
element_group 1 1
element_group 2 2
group_type 1  -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 1  1.
group_materi_memory 1  -updated_linear
group_type 2  -materi
group_materi_elasti_compressibility 2  1.
group_materi_memory 2  -updated_linear
bounda_dof 1  1 -velx
bounda_time 1  0. 0. 1.e-2 1. 2.e-2 0. 1000. 0.
bounda_dof 2  3 -velx
bounda_time 2  0. 0. 1000. 0.
control_timestep 0  1.e-3 1.e-1
target_item 0  -node_dof 1 -sigxx
target_value 0  -0.005 1.e-6
target_item 1  -node_dof 3 -sigxx
target_value 1  -0.005 1.e-6
target_item 2  -node_dof 3 -eptxx
target_value 2  -0.005 1.e-6
end_data
